  "contract": [
    "The tester of 2026-11-04 (live): when Mar'li comes up from Burrow (2118140) she goes for the player farthest",
    "from her, not a random one, and stays fixed on them for 8 s. In her spider form Burrow is cast 20.5 s after the",
    "change (2 s cast, 3 s under ground, CoA combat log of 2026-08-02). The tank holds her with the most threat, some",
