    "about 30 yards away. After the Burrow she must attack the archer, who carries Menacing Gaze (2118141) while",
    "hunted, for the whole 8 s however much threat the tank holds, and return to the tank once they are over.",
    "The tester of 2026-11-08 (live): the hunt cannot be taunted, so the tank's Hand of Reckoning (62124) during it",
    "leaves her on the archer. Under ground she shows the Hide Body display 22452 (Burrow's misc value, creature",
    "24417, as Kurinnaxx's Tunneling) and comes up in her spider display 15226 again."
